<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Starfucker</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Slayyyter</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">STARFUCKER (Deluxe)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1HBOsPD7SbbShkxh1qfTRn</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.030" end="00:03.480" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Uh-uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.480" end="00:07.870" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Uh-uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.870" end="00:11.450" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Uh-uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.450" end="00:19.450" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Uh-uh-uh, uh-uh-uh, uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.590" end="00:24.430">Think of every reason why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.430" end="00:27.970">You wanted me in your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.970" end="00:30.460">I know you got what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.460" end="00:35.160">But you're not innocent, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.160" end="00:38.930">Confessin' all my sins tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.930" end="00:42.750">Guess I gotta pay the price</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.750" end="00:44.840">Sometimes I miss my top off</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.840" end="00:49.200">Naked, you, me, alone (oh-oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.200" end="00:56.260">Maybe in another life, I'd</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.260" end="01:04.260">Be the reason you would stay behind, ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.570" end="01:07.070">Get that off my chest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.610" end="01:08.680">Now you're nothing but an ex</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.680" end="01:10.350">That's the cause, I'm the effect</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.350" end="01:12.310">Songs he spinnin' on the decks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.310" end="01:14.430">If you really wanna talk it out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.430" end="01:15.930">Then hit me up direct</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.920" end="01:18.870">Boy, you better come correct, oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.870" end="01:22.590">He's such a starfucker (uh-uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.590" end="01:25.790">He's such a starfucker (uh-uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.790" end="01:29.890">Bad to the bone type of lover (uh-uh-uh), yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.890" end="01:35.320">He's such a starfucker (uh-uh-uh, uh-uh-uh, uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.320" end="01:38.930">Took over my peace of mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.930" end="01:42.680">You're with somebody else tonight (oh, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.680" end="01:45.050">Hope she can give what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.050" end="01:50.140">But it won't be enough, oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.140" end="01:52.600">Hi, hello, it's Miss New Tits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.600" end="01:54.190">That's some new hits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.190" end="01:56.220">You're forever on my shit list</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.220" end="01:57.780">Saw your new bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.780" end="01:59.280">I'm not impressed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.050" end="02:00.920">Wishing you the bestest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.920" end="02:03.710">Hope you learned your lesson</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.710" end="02:10.820">Maybe in another life, I'd</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.820" end="02:18.820">Be the reason you would stay behind, ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.990" end="02:21.490">Get that off my chest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.270" end="02:23.160">Now you're nothing but an ex</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.160" end="02:25.040">That's the cause I'm the effect</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.040" end="02:26.810">Songs he spinnin' on the decks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.810" end="02:28.850">If you really wanna talk it out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.850" end="02:30.600">Then hit me up direct</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.600" end="02:33.380">Boy, you better come correct, oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.380" end="02:37.060">He's such a starfucker (uh-uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.060" end="02:40.180">He's such a starfucker (uh-uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.180" end="02:44.340">Bad to the bone, type of lover (uh-uh-uh), yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.340" end="02:51.180">He's such a starfucker (uh-uh-uh, uh-uh-uh, uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.180" end="02:59.180" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.880" end="03:14.320" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Remember love comes and goes)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.320" end="03:20.050" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(But fame is forever)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.050" end="03:24.050" /></div></body></tt>